<%- include('partials/header') %>

    <h1 class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open"></i> My Projects</h1>
    <p class="lead mb-4">Here are some projects and assignments I've worked on in school and on my own.</p>

    <!-- each project is a Bootstrap card: 2 per row on medium screens and up, 1 per row on phones -->
    <section class="row g-4">

        <!-- project: Python calculator -->
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h5 card-title"><i class="fa-brands fa-python"></i> Python Calculator</h2>
                    <p class="card-text">For my Intro to Programming class, I built a basic calculator using Python.
                        It handled addition, subtraction, multiplication, and division, and I added error handling so
                        the program shows an "invalid" message instead of crashing when the user tries to divide by
                        zero. The project taught me the basics of user input, conditions, and handling errors.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- project: Mortgage calculator -->
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h5 card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i> Mortgage Calculator</h2>
                    <p class="card-text">In my Business Analytics course, I built a mortgage calculator in Excel using
                        the PMT function. It takes the term, down payment, interest rate, and loan amount, and outputs
                        the monthly payment, total paid over the loan, and total interest paid. It helped me compare
                        payments and rates from different banks when shopping around for a mortgage.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- project: Auto loan calculator -->
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h5 card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-car"></i> Auto Loan Calculator</h2>
                    <p class="card-text">Also in Business Analytics, I built an auto loan calculator using the PMT and
                        NPER functions, with VLOOKUP and XLOOKUP pulling interest rates from a table based on credit
                        score. I also made a lease version that adds an input for the vehicle's residual value.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- project: Entertainment room mesh network -->
        <div class="col-md-6">
            <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm">
                <div class="card-body">
                    <h2 class="h5 card-title"><i class="fa-solid fa-wifi"></i> Entertainment Room Mesh Network</h2>
                    <p class="card-text">I set up a separate network for my basement entertainment room using a
                        TP-Link Deco mesh system, after researching forums to compare systems. Only the entertainment
                        devices, like the TV, PlayStation, Alexa, smart lights, and surround sound, connect to it, which
                        keeps traffic low and gives them the best possible speeds.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

    </section>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>